stateDiagram-v2
    state decide <<choice>>
    [*] --> Planning
    Planning --> decide
    decide --> CallingTool : a tool call is needed
    decide --> Answering : the answer is ready
    CallingTool --> Observing
    Observing --> Planning : feed the result back
    Answering --> [*]
    note right of Observing : Each observation is appended to the transcript.
